      "value": "I think you should reach out to Bunny as well on this. I think they should talk to VRChat directly. \n\nBunny can also serve arbitrary files from users, so maybe if there is a subdomain wildcard that can only serve files that are processed or analysed by Bunny. Like the reason GitHub is in the image and string loader white list, but not video has to do with m3u8 playlists.\n\nHave you considered using the white list that you can assign for the world? Users would need to have untrusted URLs enabled, but that would get things working in public instances",
