  "details": "I am a VRChat world creator and I am currently testing video hosting for music playback in my worlds.\n\nWhile testing, I discovered that videos hosted through Bunny.net CDN are blocked by the VRChat video player system because the domain is not included in the video player whitelist.\n\nThe official whitelist page:\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/video-players/www-whitelist/\n\nWould it be possible for the following Bunny CDN domains to be reviewed for inclusion on the whitelist?\n\n*.bunny.net\n\n*.b-cdn.net\n\n*.bunnycdn.com\n\nBunny.net is a reliable video CDN used by many creators and would provide a stable hosting option for VRChat worlds that rely on video playback for music or events.\n\nThank you for considering this request. I believe this would benefit many VRChat world creators who rely on video playback for music and events.",
